# area_lut6 — AREA: dc2 + rewriting + GIA mapping (sequential cmds removed: no-ops on the combinational network ABC sees)
strash; ifraig; dc2; dc2; strash;
balance; rewrite; refactor; balance; rewrite;
rewrite -z; balance; refactor -z; rewrite -z; balance;
&get -n; &st; &dch; &nf {D}; &put;
buffer; topo; upsize {D}; dnsize {D};
stime
